+## Threshold Gating (Implemented)
+- CLI option `--threshold <metric>=<min>` (repeatable) gates CI/CD on evaluation metrics.
+- Exit codes: 0 (all pass), 1 (threshold failure), 2 (usage error).
+- Reports include `passed` (JSON) and "Thresholds" section (Markdown).
+- Metrics with no score (e.g., exact_match when references missing) fail thresholds rather than crashing.
+- Available in frai-core via `generateReport(..., { thresholds: { exact_match: 0.9 } })`.
+
 ## Follow-up Tasks
 1. Integrate real toxicity/bias models once provider abstraction is implemented (Phase 0 → Providers milestone).
 2. Extend datasets loader to support configurable schema mapping.
